{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach an object, take it, check its properties or move closer and scan for objects instead.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
